. You can place units and buildings for strategic depth right from the start of the match. Unleash your creativity! Design custom bases, and share them with friends.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/86ea8f995e4e91fc3d594f77fba7f912.poster.avif?t=1733955146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/86ea8f995e4e91fc3d594f77fba7f912.webm?t=1733955146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/86ea8f995e4e91fc3d594f77fba7f912.mp4?t=1733955146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedural generated maps with Neutral Objectives</h2>Navigate, adapt, and overcome the unknown capture neutral objectives and beware of unknown creatures.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/b0436baeb2f43e39260ba2332195c5e2.poster.avif?t=1733955146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/b0436baeb2f43e39260ba2332195c5e2.webm?t=1733955146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/b0436baeb2f43e39260ba2332195c5e2.mp4?t=1733955146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Player Progression and Customization</h2>Advance through levels and unlock new challenges and cosmetics.<br>Personalize your appearance, avatar, border, and title. Stand out on the battlefield and let your enemies know who they\u2019re up against.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/573b365ccd48d269147e33af4cef7e73.poster.avif?t=1733955146\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/573b365ccd48d269147e33af4cef7e73.webm?t=1733955146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1799530/extras/573b365ccd48d269147e33af4cef7e73.mp4?t=1733955146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online Ranked Ladder Battles</h2>Challenge the Best: Test your mettle against players from around the world. Climb the ranked ladder by winning battles. Rise through the tiers\u2014from novice to grand master.<br>Elo Points: Each victory earns you Elo points, while defeats deduct them. Prove your strategic prowess and ascend to the top ranks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Game Lobbies</h2>Host Your Arena: Create custom lobbies with personalized rules. Choose map settings, and even tweak resource rates. Invite friends or fellow strategists to join your private matches.<br>Variety Unleashed: Whether it\u2019s a no-rush skirmish or a resource-rich clash, tailor the game to your liking. Experiment with unconventional strategies and settings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skirmish Against AI</h2>Training Grounds: Hone your skills. Face off against cunning AI opponents. Adjust difficulty levels\u2014from novice to deity\u2014and learn the intricacies of unit management and base building.<br>Experiment and Learn: Try out new tactics, explore the tech tree, and discover hidden synergies. The AI adapts, so stay on your toes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Single-player and Coop</h2>Tackle dynamic missions, manage your loadout, and complete objectives while strategically navigating the Playground, balancing risk to secure successful extractions and progress further.<br><br><strong>The Aztec realm awaits your command. Will you forge alliances, dominate the ranked ladder, or unravel the mysteries of Smelogs Playground? </strong>",
